{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42522","headline":"题张道隐太山祠画龙 · 蒋贻恭","name":"题张道隐太山祠画龙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人空解竞丹青，惟子通玄得墨灵。\n应有鬼神看下笔，岂无风雨助成形。\n威疑喷浪归沧海，势欲拏云上杳冥。\n静闭绿堂深夜後，晓来帘幕似闻腥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋贻恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}